SkinLoom is a from-scratch rewrite inspired by Blessing Skin Server. It reimplements
Blessing Skin's public protocols (CustomSkinLoader / UniSkinMod / legacy / Yggdrasil
endpoints) for compatibility and, where noted in the source, adapts translations and
texture-rendering approaches from it.

